The model-specific settings are: • FLUX.1-dev: 25 inference steps, with TokenRepel applied during the first 3 steps;
repulsion is applied in all 57 layers, and density preservation is applied in the first 30 layers; θ ¯ = 45 ∘ \bar{\theta}=45^{\circ} . • FLUX.2-Klein-9B: 4 inference steps, with TokenRepel applied during the first step;
repulsion is applied in all 32 layers, and density preservation is applied in the first 20 layers; θ ¯ = 60 ∘ \bar{\theta}=60^{\circ} . • SDXL: 50 inference steps, with TokenRepel applied during the first 5 steps;
repulsion is applied in all U-Net layers, and density preservation is applied in the downsample and middle layers; θ ¯ = 45 ∘ \bar{\theta}=45^{\circ} .

